comments:
0b9d1d24:  .;
 .;This program handles the parsing and initial setup for the
 .;Deferred Services tracking module.
 .;It sets up necessary variables and prepares the environment
 .;for processing individual patient records.
 .;

6f567cef:  ;
 ;The CATSET label marks the start of a routine to increment counters
 ;for managing list entries. DGJCNT tracks the total count of entries,
 ;and VALMCNT is used for visible list item counts.
 ;

b0f22162:  .;
 .;This function is designed to insert a substring into a string.
 .;S is the substring to insert, V is the original string,
 .;X is the position where the substring should be inserted,
 .;and L is the length of the substring.
 .;

e5e3f4f2:  ;
 ;This tag prepares and initializes screen positions for various fields
 ;based on the VALMDDF array configuration. It sets up column and width
 ;information for deficiency, track deficiency, standard deficiency,
 ;and category fields.
 ;
